IMPORT prelude
DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Landlord HAS name IS A STRING
    Tenant   HAS name IS A STRING
DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign    HAS signer IS AN Actor
    Deliver HAS who    IS AN Actor
theLandlord MEANS Landlord OF "Ms Ng"
alice MEANS Tenant OF "Alice"
bob MEANS Tenant OF "Bob"
tenants MEANS LIST alice, bob
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
both MEANS
  (EVERY Tenant t IN tenants MUST Sign t WITHIN 14 ONCE ALL HAVE HENCE (PARTY theLandlord MUST Deliver theLandlord WITHIN 5) LEST BREACH)
  RAND (PARTY theLandlord MUST Deliver theLandlord WITHIN 30)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
both2 MEANS
  (PARTY theLandlord MUST Deliver theLandlord WITHIN 30)
  RAND (EVERY Tenant t IN tenants MUST Sign t WITHIN 14 ONCE ALL HAVE HENCE (PARTY theLandlord MUST Deliver theLandlord WITHIN 5) LEST BREACH)
#TRACE both AT 0 WITH PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1   PARTY bob DOES Sign bob AT 2   PARTY theLandlord DOES Deliver theLandlord AT 6
#TRACE both2 AT 0 WITH PARTY alice DOES Sign alice AT 1   PARTY bob DOES Sign bob AT 2   PARTY theLandlord DOES Deliver theLandlord AT 6
